flowchart LR
  A[A line of the call] --> B([Decider: a claim?])
  B -- yes --> C[Code: resource by alias]
  C --> D([Decider: which check?])
  D --> E[Code: run it, compare]
  E -- agrees --> Q[Stay quiet]
  E -- contradicts --> F[Ledger: survives a turn?]
  F -- yes --> I[Agent: second look]
  F -- corrected --> Q
  B -- no --> G([Decider: spoken to? left hanging?])
  G -- no --> Q
  G -- yes --> J
  I -- confirmed --> J([Speak gate])
  J -- closed --> Q
  J -- open --> K[One sentence, Polly]
